  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion of the Ecole Normale d&apos;Instituteurs Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project includes expansion of the &quot;Ecole Normale d&apos;Instituters&quot; project comprising a building, a library, 2 observation rooms, 2 laboratories, one class room in the institute and 2 class rooms to be added to the primary school annexed to the institute, equipment, furniture and communication equipment, fellowships for training the students and one expert for three years.</narrative>
  </description>
